Z||000019||wkayl||01-16-2001||12:41 AM||||Lots of information there.  One suggestion for you.  If you make your main page just a link to other pages, it will load a lot quicker.  I learned that.  Also, if you run out of space (homestead limits how much you can have on a site) just make another site (I have 3).  Here is my Fiero site, it links to my other 2 sites in a round-about way.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fierowayne.homestead.com/fierowayne.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fierowayne.homestead.com/fierowayne.html</A> ||||reg||1
